{
	"schema_version": 1,
	"description": "A denomination of money (M6 spec claim 9). Credits are items, not a scalar on the player, so the save and M1's conservation property cover them without a new mechanism; a note's `value` stat is both what it is worth and what it adds to visible wealth while it is on you.",
	"properties": {
